    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structanonymous__namespace_02_d_f_a_jump_threading_8cpp_03_1_1_threading_path" kindref="compound">ThreadingPath</ref> is a path in the control flow of a loop that can be threaded by cloning necessary basic blocks and replacing conditional branches with unconditional ones. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A threading path includes a list of basic blocks, the exit state, and the block that determines the next state. </para>
